{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "74797",
  "name": "Dusit Princess Srinakarin Bangkok",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Information about the surrounding area",
      "text": "With a stay at Dusit Princess Srinakarin in Bangkok (Prawet), you\u0027ll be a 3-minute drive from Suan Luang Rama IX Park and 6 minutes from Central Bangna.  This luxury hotel is 5.8 mi (9.4 km) from Rajamangala National Stadium and 9.3 mi (15 km) from Terminal 21 Shopping Mall."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Details of room types available",
      "text": "Treat yourself to a stay in one of the 198 individually decorated guestrooms, featuring fireplaces and flat-screen televisions. Wired and wireless internet access is complimentary, while DVD players and cable programming provide entertainment. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Information about the hotel property",
      "text": "Take advantage of recreational opportunities offered, including an outdoor pool, a sauna, and a fitness center. Additional features at this hotel include complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and wedding services."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Activities available near the hotel",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003ESeacon Square - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Talad Rod Fai Night Market - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Suan Luang Rama IX Park - 2.7 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Bangna - 4.2 km / 2.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Samitivej Srinakarin Hospital - 7.8 km / 4.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Mega Bangna - 8.1 km / 5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bangkok International Trade and Exhibition Center - 8.4 km / 5.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Rajamangala National Stadium - 9.4 km / 5.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chao Praya River - 9.9 km / 6.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The Mall Bangkapi - 10.3 km / 6.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Gateway Ekamai Mall - 10.5 km / 6.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Ramkhamhaeng University - 11 km / 6.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bangkok University - 11 km / 6.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Imperial World Samrong - 11.2 km / 7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Soi Thonglor Road - 11.3 km / 7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ESuvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK) - 25.5 km / 15.8 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Don Mueang Intl. Airport (DMK) - 39.6 km / 24.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Dusit Princess Srinakarin is Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Hotel policies and disclaimer",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards; cash is not accepted\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoise-free guestrooms cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property affirms that it follows the cleaning and disinfection practices of Dusit Care (Dusit Hotels \u0026 Resorts)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E   \u003Cli\u003EOne child 6 years old or younger stays free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003EThe property has connecting/adjoining rooms, which are subject to availability and can be requested by contacting the property using the number on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EParking height restrictions apply. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-out is available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Meals and restaurants at the hotel",
      "text": "Grab a bite at Square One, one of the hotel\u0027s 2 restaurants, or stay in and take advantage of the 24-hour room service. Snacks are also available at the coffee shop/cafe. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 6 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee."
    },
    {
